(% class="legend-box" %)
**Legend:** (% style="color:#f1c40f" %)🏆 Best-in-slot(%%) · (% style="color:#7fdbff" %)⭐ Strong endgame(%%) · (% style="color:#b39ddb" %)🟣 Rare/Ex(%%) · (% style="color:#fff176" %)🟡 Rare(%%) · Links go to **bg-wiki.com**.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**Carry multiple sets.** WAR can't be optimal in one outfit — keep separate **Tank** (VIT/DEF/-Enmity), **TP** (Acc/Att/Haste), and **WS** (STR-heavy, esp. for Steel Cyclone) loadouts and macro-swap.

{{toc/}}

