<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🔮 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Koru-Moru">Koru-Moru</a></strong></td><td>Phalanx II on August, Haste backup, Slow/Distract debuffs</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>💃 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Mumor">Mumor</a></strong></td><td>Haste Samba + Stutter Step DEF debuff + 4-trigger Violent Flourish interrupts</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Tenzen">Tenzen</a></strong></td><td>Hasso/Third Eye/Meditate, holds WS to 1500 TP for bigger hits</td></tr>
